                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Congress just delivered a commonsense bill that gets results for New Jersey:\n\n\u2705 Full SALT Deduction restoration for every middle-class family\n\u2705 R&D tax credits to fuel innovation and job growth\n\u2705 Protections for Medicaid and critical health care funding\n\u2705 Permanent Child Tax Credit increase to $2,200\n\u2705 Resources for law enforcement in Somerset and Morris Counties\n\u2705 Border security, energy expansion, and government accountability\n\nThis bill, now law, will make life more affordable, and the future more secure, for New Jersey.",
