                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday marked Medicaid's 60th anniversary. I joined @repgabeevans and @repmmm in introducing a resolution to reaffirm Congress's commitment to preserving and strengthening this vital program for our nation's most vulnerable. \n\nRead more\u00a0\u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/NDsXKEJgJf",
