                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This August marks the 90th anniversary of Social Security, and to celebrate, Team Kean joined @AARP New Jersey in Fanwood for their anniversary event.\n\u00a0\nI know how important it is to protect Social Security and Medicare\u2014now and for future generations. That is why I will continue to honor the promise made to hardworking Americans who have paid into these vital programs throughout their lives.",
