                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My office hosted another Medicare Open Enrollment Information Session today for seniors in Branchburg!\n\nWe are committed to being a resource for those navigating federal programs and agencies, so my team walked through how to enroll, compare plan options, and understand coverage.\n\nReminder: Medicare Open Enrollment is underway now through December 7th. Learn more at https://t.co/imsgqgxtP7",
