                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Make no mistake: I will always advocate for my constituents and work to safeguard access to Social Security, Medicaid, and other critical programs for those they are intended to serve.\n\u00a0\nZoey reached out to my office after her disabled son\u2019s Supplemental Security Income (SSI) benefits were mistakenly discontinued. We immediately contacted the Social Security Administration to review his case and were able to get his benefits reinstated.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nIf any #NJ07 constituents are facing issues with federal agencies or having trouble accessing their benefits, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out. You can fill out a casework request here: https://t.co/FEePXnahH2",
