                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined both Democrats and Republicans to advance a new framework to make healthcare more affordable for New Jersey families.\n\nOur \u2018CommonGround 2025\u2019\u00a0plan responsibly extends the enhanced Premium Tax Credits while pairing them with targeted modifications, including PBM reform, guardrails against fraud, greater transparency, and other critical improvements.\n\u00a0\nWe need to reduce health insurance premiums for every family and we need to hold accountable drug-pricing middlemen and\u00a0fraudsters who are abusing our health care system. \n\nThrough bipartisan action, I am fighting for the people of New Jersey and driving forward a solution that Congress can deliver now.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
