                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Together with 20 Democrats & 15 Republicans in the House, I introduced a health care framework to extend the enhanced ACA tax credits. American families need relief from rising healthcare costs, and this is a bipartisan solution Congress can deliver now.\n\nhttps://t.co/XVoicTyI1P",
