                "quoted_status_profile_username": "RepBrianFitz",
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I have made it clear that we must bring down health care costs for every family in New Jersey. That is why I joined the Bipartisan Health Insurance Affordability Act \u2014 it provides a two-party solution to prevent health insurance premium spikes in the ACA marketplace, while also providing sensible reforms, lowering drug costs, and cracking down on fraud in the system.\n\nIt\u2019s time for members and leaders in Congress to come together and send a bill to the President\u2019s desk that delivers on health care affordability.",
