                "reply_count": 60,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Grateful to be named the\u00a02025 Congressional Champion of the Year\u00a0by the New Jersey Hospital Association. From holding insurance companies and PBMs accountable and fighting to lower healthcare premiums, to safeguarding Medicaid for intended beneficiaries, I remain committed to working on a bipartisan basis to protect access to affordable, high-quality healthcare for New Jersey families. \n\u00a0\nThank you to the New Jersey Hospital Association for this honor and for your continued partnership in strengthening hospitals and health systems across our state.",
